            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's changed

- Fixed a layout issue that could push the Ask Gemini panel and its header controls outside the reader window. Both panes now stay within the window, and the PDF toolbar can scroll horizontally when space is tight.

**Full changelog**: https://github.com/basicv8vc/YoPDF/compare/v2026.11.24.2...v2026.11.25
]]></description>
